          "hideComponent": "false",
          "jcr:created": "Tue Dec 12 2023 22:34:40 GMT+0000",
          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-2em\">The Fixos screw system is a single use device intended for the fixation, correction or stabilization of small and long bones in adult and adolescent patients&nbsp;available in 4.0mm, 5.0mm and 7.0mm headless screw sizes.</span></span></p>\n<h3><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\">Not just a screw.</span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-2em\">We offer a full range of headless compression screw options for your midfoot and rearfoot fusion needs. The patented thread configuration features a reverse thread designed for enhanced compression&nbsp;and fixation.<sup>1</sup></span></span></p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Aug 14 2026 14:35:45 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        },
        "text_copy_copy": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "bottomPadding": "2",
          "jcr:createdBy": "user-65eab19e7c@example.invalid",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-42b58e166b@example.invalid",
          "hideComponent": "false",
          "jcr:created": "Tue Dec 12 2023 22:34:40 GMT+0000",
          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">4.0, 5.0, 7.0 size options</span></li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Fixation for a variety of fusions and osteotomies</span></li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Type 2 Anodized Titanium</span></li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Reverse cutting flutes</span></li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Interchangeable instrument tray modules and modular screw racks to help meet the needs of your practice</span></li>\n</ul>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Aug 14 2026 14:35:08 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      }
    },
